  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "耐熱素材で　するどいツメでも　破れない最新の　繊維加工　技術で　作られたアカデミー指定の　テーブルクロス。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "내열 소재에 예리한 손톱에도 찢어지지 않는 최신 섬유 가공 기술로 만들어진 아카데미 지정 테이블보.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "學院指定的桌巾。採用耐熱素材，並結合即使被銳利之爪攻擊也不會破損的最新型纖維加工技術製成。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe fournie par l’académie. Grâce aux dernières technologies textiles, elle est ignifugée et assez solide pour résister aux coups d’une Griffe Rasoir.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Das offizielle Akademie-Tischtuch aus hitzebeständigem Material. Dank hochmoderner Faserverarbeitung kann nicht einmal eine Scharfklaue dem Stoff etwas anhaben.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El mantel oficial de la academia, fabricado con un material de última tecnología resistente tanto al fuego como a los arañazos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tovaglia con il design regolamentare dell’accademia, realizzata in materiale ignifugo, trattato con processi all’avanguardia. Neanche un Affilartiglio può strapparla.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The academy’s standard-issue tablecloth. It’s made with the latest fiber-processing technology and is so tough that not even a Razor Claw can tear it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "耐熱素材で　するどいツメでも　破れない最新の　繊維加工　技術で　作られたアカデミー指定の　テーブルクロス。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "学院指定的桌巾。采用耐热材料，以最新的纤维加工技术制成。即使是使用锐利之爪都不能弄破。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
